 81GA2cB where otherwise noted.                                                 
 81GA cL E         From a least-squares fitting to the E|g.                     
 81GA cL J         From Adopted Levels.                                         
 81GA cL T(A)      From 2020Pa26, from the Advanced Time-Delayed |b|g|g(t)      
 81GA2cL fast-timing method.                                                    
