 81GE cL J(D)      1/2- is expected, based on systematics of J|p (isomeric      
 81GE2cL state) in other odd-mass N=49 isotones. However, if J|p=1/2-,          
 81GE3cL B(M4)(W.u.)<1.4 (low cf. values ranging from 7.0 {I5} to 19 {I1} for   
 81GE4cL seven known M4 transitions between 1/2- and 9/2+ states (1979En04)).   
 81GE5cL Therefore, 1981Ho24 presume that the 679 level is the 1/2+ level       
 81GE6cL also expected at low energy (based on level energy systematics), and   
 81GE7cL that the 1/2- state is the 896 level which deexcites via an E1         
 81GE8cL transition to the 679 level.                                           
