 81GE    82GA B-N DECAY                2016AL10,1980HOZN,2016TE0925NDS    202501
 81GE  H TYP=FUL$AUT=M. Shamsuzzoha Basunia$CIT=NDS 199, 271 (2025)$            
 81GE2 H CUT=1-Sep-2024$                                                        
 81GE c  Others: 2017Ve01, 1986Wa17, 1980Lu04.                                  
 81GE c  2016Al10: {+82}Ga produced in the fission of {+238}UC{-x} target (6    
 81GE2c  g/cm{+2} thickness) by a 50 MeV, 10-18 |mA proton beam from the        
 81GE3c  Holifield Radioactive Ion beam facility (HRIBF) at Oak Ridge National  
 81GE4c  Laboratory, followed by a two-step high-resolution mass separation.    
 81GE5c  The radioactive ion beam was implanted on a moving tape collector      
 81GE6c  (MTC) surrounded by four HPGe detectors for |g rays and two plastic    
 81GE7c  scintillators for |b detection. The counting cycle was four seconds    
 81GE8c  implantation of ion beam on the tape, followed by two seconds of decay 
 81GE9c  measurement. Measured E|g, I|g, |b|g-coin, |g|g-coin. Deduced level    
 81GEac  scheme of {+81}Ge, and J|p.                                            
 81GE c  1980HoZN: Source: from mass-separated fission products.                
 81GE2c  Singles |g and |g|g-coincidences measured with                         
 81GE3c  Ge(Li); x-ray detector for low energy |g search (E|g|>15 keV);         
 81GE4c  Si(Li) detector for simultaneous measurement of ce and |g              
 81GE5c  spectra for |a(K)exp determination.                                    
 81GE c  2016Te09: {+82}Ga beam, E=30 keV, was produced in                      
 81GE2c  photofission of {+238}U using UC{-x} pellets containing about 60 g of  
 81GE3c  {+238}U. Mass-separated {+82}Ga beam was then sent to |b-decay counting
 81GE4c  station BEDO where it was collected on mylar tape at the center of the 
 81GE5c  detection system of 4|p {+3}He neutron counter TETRA, an HPGe detector 
 81GE6c  for |g radiation and plastic 4|p|b array for electrons. Measured E|g,  
 81GE7c  I|g, |b spectrum, |b-gated |g and |b(neutron)-gated |g spectra, delayed
 81GE8c  neutrons, %|b{+-}n, and half-life of {+82}Ga decay for 1700 counting   
 81GE9c  cycles in beam-off and beam-on collection/counting steps. See also     
 81GEac  2017Ve01.                                                              
