 81GE cL T         From 1981Ho24, except where otherwise noted, based on        
 81GE2cL analysis of {+81}Ga decay and |b|g coin measurements,                  
 81GE3cL it is evident that there are two |b{+-} decaying isomers in {+81}Ge    
 81GE4cL (g.s. and 1st excited state) but, in multispectrum analysis of mass    
 81GE5cL number 81, it was not possible to differentiate between the two        
 81GE6cL half-lives. Hence, 1981Ho24 conclude that the isomers (g.s. and 1st    
 81GE7cL excited state) possess similar T{-1/2} values.                         
