 81AS2cG in 1980HoZN, not in 1981Ho24. Unplaced |gs are from 1980HoZN.          
 81AS cG RI        From 2022De07, except where otherwise noted. In 1980HoZN,    
 81AS2cG total I|g(335)=100 {I4} for g.s. and isomeric decays [from 83 {I3} and 
 81AS3cG 17 {I3}]. Scaling factor of 100/83 was used to normalize the 1980HoZN  
 81AS4cG data listed in the comments. I|g were divided for common |g rays. In   
 81AS5cG 2022De07, reported I|g for the purified g.s. decay only.               
