 81KR    81RB EC DECAY (30.5 M)        1977LI14                  25NDS    202501
 81KR  H TYP=FUL$AUT=M. Shamsuzzoha Basunia$CIT=NDS 199, 271 (2025)$            
 81KR2 H CUT=1-Sep-2024$                                                        
 81KR c  Others: 1956Do52, 1969Ha03, 1981FrZY.                                  
 81KR c  Only 1977Li14 and 1981FrZY report the decay                            
 81KR2c  of the 30.5-min isomer of {+81}Rb; others report the 4.571-h decay     
 81KR3c  alone. The assignment to one or other isomer was made by 1977Li14 on   
 81KR4c  the basis of half-lives of the |g's and coincidence                    
 81KR5c  measurements. However, while 1977Li14 found numerous |g's belonging to 
 81KR6c  the 30.5-min decay, 1981FrZY found only the 49.6|g following the       
 81KR7c  30.5-min half-life. Consequently, this decay scheme                    
 81KR8c  probably should be accepted with caution.                              
 81KR c  1977Li14: E|g, I|g, |g|g-coin, and internal conversion                 
 81KR2c  measurement; Ge(Li) (FWHM=2.5 keV at 1.33 MeV), |b spectrometer.       
