 81KR3c  E|g, I|g, |g|g coin (timing FWHM=20 ns).                               
 81KR c  The level scheme is basically that of 1979To08. However, the           
 81KR2c  evaluator has introduced a pair of levels at both 976 keV and 1744 keV,
 81KR3c  consistent with findings in other reaction studies.                    
 81KR cG E(C)$Poor fit; uncertainty multiplied by a factor in the fitting       
 81KR cG E(Q)$Very Poor fit and omitted in the fitting                          
 81KR cG           The assignment of the unplaced |g's to {+81}Kr is not always 
 81KR2cG certain.                                                               
 81KR cG E         From 1979To08, except as noted. Evaluator suspects that |DE  
 81KR2cG has been underestimated by 1979To08 since E|g differs from the         
 81KR3cG least-squares adjusted value for a number of lines; alternatively,     
 81KR4cG several |g may have been misplaced.                                    
 81KR cG E(F)      |g unplaced in 1979To08; placed by evaluator by analogy      
 81KR2cG with {+81}Rb |e decay (4.571 h).                                       
 81KR cG RI        Relative photon intensity from singles |g spectrum for       
 81KR2cG E(p)=4.0 MeV (1979To08), except as noted.                              
 81KR cG RI(B)     From n|g coin |g spectrum (1979To08). I|g values determined  
 81KR2cG by this means are generally consistent with those from singles |g      
 81KR3cG spectrum, but there exist several unexplained inconsistencies; in such 
 81KR4cG cases, the authors' choice of I|g is adopted and the discrepancy is    
 81KR5cG noted.                                                                 
 81KR cG RI(D)     From level scheme of 1979To08. I|g tabulated in 1979To08 is  
 81KR2cG total I|g for multiplet.                                               
 81KR cG RI(G)     From adopted I(644|g)/I(1099|g)=0.025 {I13} for 1100 level,  
 81KR2cG and I(1100|g) and I|g(644 doublet)=3.5 {I4} here, evaluator deduced    
 81KR3cG I(644|g from 1100 level)=0.6 {I3}, leaving I|g=2.9 {I5} for 644|g from 
 81KRxcG 1744 level.                                                            
 81KR cG RI(H)     From I(729|g)/I(219|g+283|g) for 920 level in 4.6 h |e decay,
 81KR2cG and I(219|g+283|g) and I|g(729 doublet)=90.0 {I23} here, evaluator     
 81KR3cG deduces I(729|g)=58 {I12} from 920 level in (p,n|g), leaving I|g=32    
 81KR4cG {I12} to be placed elsewhere. One expects I(729|g)=0.8 or 2.3 from     
 81KR5cG 1744 level based on I(729|g)/I(1195|g) or I(729|g)/I(1744|g),          
 81KR6cG respectively, from 4.6 h |e decay, so evaluator places I|g=1.6 {I8}    
 81KR7cG from 1744 level, leaving I(729|g)=30 {I12} which is shown as an        
 81KR8cG additional unplaced |g. I|g(729 doublet)=101 {I3} in n-gated |g        
 81KRxcG spectrum.                                                              
 81KR cG RI(I)     From adopted I(758|g)/I(1041|g) for 1678 level, and I(1041|g)
 81KR2cG and I|g(758 doublet)=2.2 {I5} here, evaluator deduces I(758|g from 1678
 81KR3cG level)=0.43 {I6}, leaving I|g=1.8 {I5} for 758|g from 1396 level.      
 81KR cG RI(J)     From adopted I(977|g)/I(1041|g) for 1678 level, and I(1041|g)
 81KR2cG and I|g(977 triplet)=5.0 {I7} here, evaluator deduces I(977|g from 1678
 81KR3cG level)=4.8 {I7}, leaving I|g=0.2 {I9} for 977|g from 976+1990 levels.  
 81KR4cG The tentative placement of a component of the 977|g from the 977 level 
 81KR5cG comes from 1979To08 alone, and has not been included in Adopted        
 81KR6cG Levels, Gammas.                                                        
 81KR cG RI(K)     From adopted I(1014|g)/I(465|g) for 1015 level, and I(465|g) 
 81KR2cG and I|g(1014 doublet)=5.3 {I13} from n-gated |g spectrum, evaluator    
 81KR3cG deduces I(1014|g from 1014 level)=1.65, leaving I|g=3.65 for 1014|g    
 81KR4cG from 1990 level. Doublet overlapped by unknown transition(s)           
 81KR5cG (presumably not from {+81}Kr) in                                       
 81KR6cG singles |g spectrum, where I|g(multiplet)=15.8 {I7}.                   
 81KR cG RI(L)     From adopted I(1048|g)/I(538|g) for 1239 level, and I(538|g) 
 81KR2cG and I|g(1048 doublet)=2.8 {I6} here, evaluator deduces I(1048|g from   
 81KR3cG 1239 level)=3.0 {I13}, leaving I|g=-0.2 {I14} for 1048|g from 1505     
 81KR4cG level.                                                                 
 81KR cG RI(M)     From adopted I(1087|g)/I(1429|g) for 2064 level, and         
 81KR2cG I(1429|g) and I|g(1087 triplet)=9.4 {I7} here, evaluator deduces       
 81KR3cG I(1087|g from 2064 level)=1.6 {I6}, leaving I|g=7.8 {I9} for 1087|g    
 81KR4cG from 1278+1990 levels.                                                 
 81KR cG RI(N)     I(1136|g)/I(1108|g)=1.19 {I30} in this dataset is much higher
 81KR2cG compared to the ratio of I(1136|g)/I(1108|g)=0.23 {I5} in the adopted  
 81KR3cG dataset. A weak 1135.0|g is placed from 2069 keV level in (|a,n|g).    
 81KR cG E(O)      E|g differs from least-squares adjusted value by |>3|s.      
 81KR cG RI(P)     I|g=19.1 {I11} for doublet in singles |g spectrum, 13.4      
 81KR2cG {I24} in n-gated |g spectrum. From adopted branching for 732 level and 
 81KR3cG I(682|g), one expects I(732|g)=13.3 {I23} from 732 level, leaving      
 81KR4cG I(732|g)=0.1 {I33} from 1281 level.                                    
 81KR cG M,MR      From |a(K)exp (1979To08), measured with electron spectrometer
 81KR2cG (relative efficiency determined using 10 well-known |a(K)'s from       
 81KR3cG various reactions); values relative to |a(K)(499.5|g,                  
 81KRxcG {+81}Kr)=E2(theory)=0.00263.                                           
 81KR cG M(E)      Not adopted. Inconsistent with log| {Ift} in                 
 81KR2cG {+81}Rb |e decay (4.571 h); reason for discrepancy not known.          
 81KR cL E         From a least-squares fit to E|g, omitting a few E|g lines.   
