 81KR c  2022Mu09: E(|a)=65, 68 MeV. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g-coin,              
 81KR2c  |g|g(|q)(ADO), |g|g(linear polarization) using AFRODITE array with     
 81KR3c  eight Compton-suppressed clover Ge detectors at the iThemba Labs.      
 81KR4c  Deduced high-spin levels, J|p, B(M1)/B(E2), bands, quasiparticle       
 81KR5c  alignments, configurations, chiral doublet bands, and pseudospin-chiral
 81KR6c  triplet bands. Comparison with constrained covariant density functional
 81KR7c  theory, and multiparticle plus rotor model calculations.               
 81KR d  Gamma-ray data details such as relative intensities, numerical values  
 81KR2d  of |g|g(|q)(ADO), and |g|g(linear pol) were requested by B. Singh from 
 81KR3d  the corresponding author of 2022Mu09 on Aug 29, 2022, but no response  
 81KR4d  was received as of November 25, 2022.                                  
 81KR5d  The evaluator also sent a request on March 28, 2023.                   
