 81RB3cL (via a 761.4|g to the 15/2- 2294 level) to the near-yrast |p=-, |a=-1/2
 81RB4cL band in ({+19}F,|a2n|g), but assigned as an independent |p=+ band in   
 81RB5cL ({+31}P,2pn|g). See comment on J|p(3055 level). In ({+31}P,2pn|g), a   
