 81RB3cL alternatively, K|p=11/2- band arising from odd p coupled to aligned    
 81RB4cL pair of g{-9/2} neutrons (1993LiZR).                                   
 81RB5cL A 155|g, appearing in cascade between the 61|g and 210|g in            
 81RB6cL {+53}Cr({+31}P,2pn|g) is absent in {+68}Zn({+19}F,|a2n|g), and the     
