 81RB c  1993LiZR: E=97 MeV; TESSA3 array (16 BGO suppressed Ge detectors with  
 81RB2c  50-element inner BGO ball for |g sum energy and multiplicity           
 81RB3c  measurements); measured E|g, |g|g coin, |g|g|g coin, DCO ratios. See   
 81RB4c  also 1993LiZX.                                                         
 81RB cG E         From 1993LiZX; |DE unstated by authors. E|g values appear to 
 81RB2cG be slightly lower than those in {+68}Zn({+19}F,|a2n|g).                
 81RB cG E(B)      Transition has not been confirmed in a subsequent            
 81RB2cG ({+19}F,|a2n|g) study with superior statistics. Since the present      
 81RB3cG study has not been published, the evaluator has chosen not to include  
 81RB4cG this transition in Adopted Gammas.                                     
 81RB cL           The level scheme is that of 1993LiZR; it differs from that of
 81RB2cL 1993LiZX only due to the placement of a 63-keV |g in the cascade       
 81RB3cL in the 3-quasiparticle band and a revision of the transitions          
 81RB4cL connecting that band with the |p=- and |p=+ yrast bands. It does,      
 81RB5cL however, differ from the level scheme deduced from the                 
 81RB6cL {+68}Zn({+19}F,|a2n|g) reaction in several significant respects; see   
 81RB7cL comment on level scheme in Adopted Levels.                             
 81RB cL E         From a least-squares fit to E|g, assuming |DE=0.5 keV for all
 81RB2cL definitely placed gammas and holding 86.3 keV level energy fixed.      
 81RB cL J         From 1993LiZR, except otherwise noted. Proposed J{+|p} in    
 81RB2cL 1993LiZR are based on unenumerated DCO ratios and the                  
 81RB3cL regular progression of the transition energies within proposed bands.  
 81RB4cL Unless noted to the contrary (see comment on g{-9/2} yrast band),      
 81RB5cL values are consistent with adopted J|p, but many adopted values        
 81RB6cL have parentheses added.                                                
