 81RB2cN I|g(443|g)=24.2 {I18} (1973Br32), assuming theoretical                 
 81RB3cN I|b{++}/I(|e+|b{++}) ratios. The decay scheme is incomplete and the    
 81RB4cN normalization to be considered as approximate.                         
 81RB dN $NR details: relative intensity balance at 443 level=I(|e+|b{++})=101  
 81RB2dN {I4} yields I|b{++}=91 {I4} and the ratio is I|b{++}/I(|e+|b{++})=0.90 
 81RB3dN {I5}. Then NR=[0.90(5)/(245(20)/2)]*24.2(18)=0.178 {I22}. Note that    
