 81RB c  2017Ce01: E=95 MeV {+37}Cl beam was produced from the TANDEM linear    
 81RB2c  accelerator complex at the Laboratori Nazionali di Legnaro (LNL),      
 81RB3c  Italy. Target was 0.5 mg/cm{+2} {+44}Ca. Low-energy |g rays were       
 81RB4c  detected with the AGATA array of segmented HPGe detectors and          
 81RB5c  high-energy |g rays were detected with the HECTOR{++} array of         
 81RB6c  large-volume LaBr{-3}:Ce detectors. Measured E|g, |g yields, |g|g-coin.
 81RB7c  Deduced isovector giant dipole resonance (IVGDR) parameters, centroid, 
 81RB8c  width, and strength. Used as a reference reaction and results applied  
 81RB9c  to deduce isospin mixing in {+80}Zr populated in the {+40}Ca+{+40}Ca   
 81RBac  reaction.                                                              
