 81SR c  Other Reactions:                                                       
 81SR2c  Fe({+28}Si,X|g), E({+28}Si)=95 MeV; CAESAR detector array (7 in-plane, 
 81SR3c  Compton-suppressed Ge detectors); magnetic field perpendicular to      
 81SR4c  detector plane; measured (unperturbed) DCO to determine alignment      
 81SR5c  parameter |s/J=0.36 {I2}; measurements are ongoing to determine        
 81SR6c  hyperfine field of Sr in Fe and lifetime of 221 level, both of which   
 81SR7c  are of relevance to a determination of the g-factor for the 221 level  
 81SR8c  (2001St09, 2002Ro36).                                                  
