 81SR2cL {I+18-16} (1999Le56), 3.08 {I+16-15} (2003Le08), 3.5 {I+8-7} (1997De51,
 81SR3cL reanalysis of data of 1995Ch56). Configuration: |n5{+1}|p5{+0}         
 81SR4cL (2003Le08). Percent population=1.02 (2003Le08), |?1.5 (1995Ch56).      
 81SR5cL Probable (|p,|a)=(-,+1/2) corresponding to configuration: ((|n         
 81SR6cL 1/2[550]){+-1}). Predicted |b{-2}=0.50 (1995Ch56).                     
