 81SR2cG 1982De36, listed in comments, are in agreement, except for I|g(79).    
 81SR cG M,MR      From Adopted Gammas, except as noted.                        
 81SR cG E(A)      Unresolved from much stronger 221|g from {+83}Zr |e decay.   
 81SR2cG Decay time of multiplet indicates that most of the intensity comes from
 81SR3cG the A=83 chain (1985Li12).                                             
