 81Y 2cG by authors.                                                            
 81Y  cG RI(E)     Based on transition line widths in the level scheme drawing  
 81Y 2cG of 1997Sc17 in {+58}Ni({+32}S,2|ap|g), this is the most intense |g     
 81Y 3cG deexciting its parent level.                                           
