 81Y 3cL extensive study using the ({+32}S,2|ap|g) reaction. For this reason,   
 81Y 4cL level is shown as tentative here.                                      
 81Y  cL T(G)      |g|g(t) and particle-|g(t) data from 1985Li12 indicate that  
