 81ZR c  {+58}Ni+{+32}S, E({+32}S)=150 MeV; HPGe and Si(Au) (FWHM=60 keV)       
 81ZR2c  detectors (1997Hu15, 1999Hu05).                                        
 81ZR c  Other: 1965Za02.                                                       
 81ZR c                                                                         
 81ZR c  From shape of |e-delayed p spectrum, 1999Hu05 deduce                   
 81ZR2c  Q(|e)-S(p)({+81}Y)=4.7 MeV {I2} (cf. 4.52 MeV {I13} (2021Wa16)). See   
 81ZR3c  1984Ha58 and 1997Hu15 for proton spectrum from {+81}Zr |ep decay. The  
 81ZR4c  measured |b{++} endpoint energy is 6.14 MeV {I25} (1982De36); the      
 81ZR2c  {+81}Y level population has not been established.                      
 81ZR cG E,RI      From data of 2004Ma39 in {+58}Ni({+28}Si,|an|g).             
 81ZR cG M         From |g(|q) in {+58}Ni({+28}Si,|an|g), assigning |D|p=(no)   
 81ZR2cG to intraband transitions, except as noted.                             
 81ZR cL E         From-least squares fit to E|g.                               
 81ZR cL J         Based on energy systematics in neighboring                   
 81ZR2cL N=41 isotones or T{-z}=1/2 nuclides, and supported by measured ADO     
 81ZR3cL and DCO ratios and |g(|q) in {+58}Ni({+28}Si,|an|g), except as noted.  
 81ZR cL J(Y)      From 1999Hu05 and 2005Xu04; leads to consistency between     
 81ZR2cL measured p spectrum and statistical model calculations using level     
 81ZR3cL densities from backshifted Fermi gas model (1999Hu05), but statistics  
 81ZR4cL are too poor to differentiate between several alternative J|p          
 81ZR5cL possibilities. See also 2005Xu04. J|p=3/2(-) for {+79}Sr isotone.      
 81ZR cL T(Z)      Weighted average of 5.3 s {I5} (386|g(t)({+80}Sr), 1997Hu15; 
 81ZR2cL see also 1999Hu05), 5.9 s {I6} (1977FaZW), 6.3 s {I5} (1976HaWO),      
 81ZR3cL 5.0 s {I2} and 4.8 s {I5} (from the decay curves for |b events         
 81ZR4cL correlated with {+81}Z implantations and |g(113,175,230)(t),           
 81ZR5cL respectively in 2009St04).                                             
 81ZR6cL Others: 15 s {I5} from |b{++}(t) for component of A=81 mass spectrum   
 81ZR7cL (1982De36); 1997Hu15 suggest that this datum may have been corrupted   
 81ZR8cL due to the direct production of 70 s {+81}Y in the reaction used by    
 81ZR9cL 1982De36. T{-1/2}=7-15 min from 1965Za02 suggests an erroneous isotopic
 81ZRacL assignment.                                                            
